# The analyser is advertised as arcifact.io/r/<org>/<repo> and must be
# reachable there. It runs on the worker; proxying keeps the address we
# publish true rather than asking the reader to accept a different one.
/r/*    https://arcifact-gate.founder-ada.workers.dev/r/:splat    200
/install-contract   https://arcifact-gate.founder-ada.workers.dev/install   200
/semantics          https://arcifact-gate.founder-ada.workers.dev/semantics 200
